html
input creates a field where the user can type.
type="text" allows text.
id="itemName" gives the field a unique name JavaScript can use.
placeholder displays a hint.
list container
This is an empty list. JavaScript will put shopping items inside it.
total-cost
JavaScript will update this number whenever the shopping list changes.
the Script
This connects your JavaScript file to the webpage. The defer attribute ensures the HTML is parsed before the script runs.